          "line": 117,
          "declaration": "theorem complete_classical_AP_le_clamp_theta {τ ε : ℝ}\n    (hτ : 0 < τ) (hτ' : τ ≤ 1/12) (he : 0 < ε) :\n    ∀ᶠ N : ℕ in atTop, ∀ n m : ℕ, 1/((n:ℝ)+1) ≤ 11/384 →\n      (∑ p ∈ classicalBand N, |signedAP N p (rootQ N n .U3 τ p)\n        (cutoffAt N n m p τ)|) ≤ ε * clampMass N n τ"
