          "declaration": "theorem actual_classical_amplitudes {N n m p : ℕ} {τ : ℝ}\n    (hN : 2 ≤ N) (hτ : 0 ≤ τ) (hτ' : τ ≤ 1/12)\n    (hn : 1/((n:ℝ)+1) ≤ 11/384) (hp : p ∈ classicalBand N) :\n    upperAmplitude (frozenQuery n .U3 τ (physicalPrime N p)) = 1 ∧\n      P5CanonicalUpperCancellation.upperA (queryAt (keyAt N n m .U3 τ p)) = 1"
